The map data in this folder (data-src/), except data-src/floors/, and the data compiled from it (public/data/) are
made available under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
Any rights in individual contents of the database are licensed under the Database Contents License v1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

It contains data from OpenStreetMap, © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the ODbL
(https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). The test extracts in scripts/fixtures/ come from the same source under
the same licence.

Indoor floor plans (data-src/floors/, and anything in public/data/ compiled from them) are not under this or any
other license: not ours to license yet (D21). They are traced from De La Salle University's evacuation maps, and
whether they may be published is still an open question for the university (docs/DECISIONS.md, D4 and D21).

Photos (data-src/photos/) are never committed and are not part of this database.
